   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   RowBox[{",", " ", "{"}], 
   StyleBox["prop1", "TI"], 
   RowBox[{",", " "}], 
   StyleBox["prop2", "TI"], 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{",", " ", "\[Ellipsis]"}], "}"}], "]"}]}]], "InlineFormula", 
  ExpressionUUID->"3236e27b-a7c0-714c-8e21-c9ee5ab4456f"],
 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "gives a list ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   StyleBox["prop1", "TI"], 
   RowBox[{",", " "}], 
   StyleBox["prop2", "TI"], 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{",", " ", "\[Ellipsis]"}], "}"}]}]], "InlineFormula", 
  ExpressionUUID->"4acf7d05-5b19-8c4a-b0ad-18af1f7ca9a5"],
 " of properties at each step."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->430448520, ExpressionUUID->"2724e514-ca36-cc45-b0fd-ba8fec8728a0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In a step of evolution in a cyclic tag system, the first element of the \
tape is deleted. If the first element was 0, no elements are added to the end \
of the tape. If the first element was 1, then the first block in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["rules", "TI"]], "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID->
  "b6bdc16a-95fa-6348-a751-6220af0b54e0"],
 " is added to the end of the tape. At every evolution step, the blocks in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["rules", "TI"]], "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID->
  "60572fcb-f1bc-d246-8fb8-8067765ae663"],
 " are rotated left one step so that the first block goes to the end of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["rules", "TI"]], "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID->
  "c953a6ab-1892-6a47-9a94-6e6cb5a72ae4"],
 "."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->118407882, ExpressionUUID->"4fbfc2ee-d1d3-3a43-8b20-671fb3d82d9a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The argument ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["rules", "TI"]], "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID->
  "bb77efba-fbed-df4e-8771-f4f69293e90a"],
 " should be given as a list, where each element is a list specifying a block \
of digits to be added to the end of the tape, such as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", "0", "}"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]], 
  "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID->"8b2a004d-9ae1-f544-bcfd-06f09bf9df43"],
 "."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->840317386, ExpressionUUID->"00c0efeb-6b4b-1f44-9af5-69289b2fffad"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The argument ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["init", "TI"]], "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID->
  "36edaf38-63e1-7b46-a639-ca358a45d0d4"],
 " should be given as a list that specifies the initial tape configuration, \
such as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}]], 
  "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID->"bcc9a181-7c8d-0b41-8feb-4221fe2264b5"],
 "."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->587791968, ExpressionUUID->"3eb1614b-3208-f641-af04-6ef68056a246"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The result has ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["t", "TI"]], "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID->
  "d98e23c1-2f3e-c149-89d2-b8e393dde580"],
 " + 1 elements, the first of which is for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["init", "TI"]], "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID->
  "6c01aef5-ac91-ca49-a651-4ae482d62cce"],
 ". Once the tape is empty, it stays empty."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->461655069, ExpressionUUID->"f6046983-fcfb-e042-aa5f-c09bc2b6292d"],

Cell["The following properties can be given:", "Notes",
 CellID->56621341, ExpressionUUID->"37b09352-4de4-364d-9a02-b0e3cd256855"],

Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo", ExpressionUUID->
     "8f08e677-3930-e348-b37f-0aeb4bc3a6b0"], Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<States\>\""], "TableText", ExpressionUUID->
     "3b240b94-a5b9-494c-a2ba-9b2455c1c5b9"], Cell[
    "the tape at each step (the default)", "TableText", ExpressionUUID->
     "f810313a-0ceb-6e42-8335-1f3f2bd0045a"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo", ExpressionUUID->
     "b40317db-b35b-5e4d-b8da-4e9170bca04b"], Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<Rules\>\""], "TableText", ExpressionUUID->
     "6f591fd6-494a-2542-b5a9-b7b9a845e773"], Cell[TextData[{
     "the block at the front of ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox["rules", "TI"]], "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID->
      "ded3b03c-b776-f945-88fe-4bc6bc8c0533"],
     " at each step, which is added to the end of the tape if the first \
element of the tape is 1"
    }], "TableText", ExpressionUUID->"1632f867-517a-4f45-ae7d-28a6e3cfd912"]}
  }]], "2ColumnTableMod",
 CellID->512455948, ExpressionUUID->"a6b6be70-b179-6f4a-a5c0-e7989652f2e9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "With a list of properties, each element of the result is the list of those \
properties at that step. For example, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", "\"\<States\>\"", 
   RowBox[{",", " "}], "\"\<Rules\>\"", "}"}]], "InlineFormula", 
  ExpressionUUID->"5c7fc1ee-e49b-4649-baa1-38b7d57d5df6"],
 " gives ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   StyleBox["tape", "TI"], 
   RowBox[{",", " "}], 
   StyleBox["block", "TI"], "}"}]], "InlineFormula", ExpressionUUID->
  "25e1e7a2-3171-8449-8a14-235fa96b1f35"],
 " at each step."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->97640389, ExpressionUUID->"7ac837d8-19cb-1240-b645-da25fb3d3983"],

